{{!--
  Regenerable files: build output, caches, environments and scratch. Syncthing
  never replicates them and rustic never backs them up.

  Spliced into ~/.rusticignore and every .stignore through include_template, so
  each line must mean the same in gitignore and Syncthing syntax. Only bare,
  unanchored names and globs qualify, and never a `!` negation: Syncthing takes
  the first matching line where gitignore takes the last. Comments live in this
  handlebars block because the two formats share no comment syntax.

  Rustic also skips any directory holding CACHEDIR.TAG. Syncthing has no
  equivalent, so tagged caches are still named here.
--}}
.stversions

target

node_modules
bower_components
.next
dist

.venv*
.hatch
.tox
.nox
.direnv
__pycache__
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.mypy_cache
.ipynb_checkpoints

.esphome
.pio

*~
.*.swp
*.part
*.crdownload

.DS_Store
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
._*
desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
